  "statement": "Let \\((x, y)\\) be a pair of real numbers satisfying\n\n\\[56 x+33 y=\\frac{-y}{x^{2}+y^{2}}, \\quad \\text { and } \\quad 33 x-56 y=\\frac{x}{x^{2}+y^{2}}\\]\n\nDetermine the value of \\(|x|+|y|\\).",
  "answerChoices": [],
